### 1. List all halls as admin (no filters — expect 5 halls from seed, all FREE)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/halls
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 2. Filter by zone "COLTECH" (expect 2 halls)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/halls?zone=COLTECH
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 3. Filter by tier "amphi" (expect 3 amphis)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/halls?tier=amphi
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 4. Filter by zone "COLTECH" AND tier "medium" (expect 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/halls?zone=COLTECH&tier=medium
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 5. Invalid tier (expect 422)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/halls?tier=huge
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 6. No auth (expect 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/halls

### 7. Suggest a new hall (expect 201, status pending)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/halls/suggest
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "COLTECH Lab 3",
  "zone": "COLTECH",
  "capacityTier": "small",
  "approxCapacityRange": "< 50"
}

### 8. Suggest duplicate (expect 409 HALL_EXISTS)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/halls/suggest
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Amphi 1000",
  "zone": "Main Campus Amphis",
